Package: plasma-activities-stats
Version: @DEB_PLASMAACTIVITIESSTATS_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://kde.org/
Depends: qt6-base, plasma-activities
Description: PlasmaActivitiesStats for the Xios desktop
 Client library for querying Plasma activity resource statistics. This is a
 hard plasma-workspace dependency on the path to plasmashell.
 .
 Part of the KDE Plasma Desktop and Plasma Mobile support layer for Xios.
